// # Const integer add-of-three println for WASI emit
//
// Logline: Print 1 + 2 + 3 so emit-wasm can plant a WASI fd_write body of 6.
//
// Setup: No imports. One public main. The body is only println of three INT literals plus.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare public main.
//   2. Print 1 + 2 + 3.
//   3. Leave no other statements so a three-add helper can see a print-only body.

pub fn main() { println(1 + 2 + 3); }
